{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"「瘋狂計程車：極速環遊」最終目的地「印度」地圖公開！還有以導覽風格介紹印度地圖魅力的全新預告片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/29dc5847c92fb5d6467258f902705ac1241f95db5808bb8d0c61d3605e5ad320/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fcc00e1152ebc683a4378b1387c502050.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「瘋狂計程車：極速環遊」最終目的地「印度」地圖公開！還有以導覽風格介紹印度地圖魅力的全新預告片</figcaption></figure><p>SEGA株式會社，在計劃於2027年發售的「<strong>瘋狂計程車：極速環遊</strong>」中，將新增「<strong>印度</strong>」作為第五座可遊玩城市。<br/>介紹印度地圖魅力的預告片也已發布。</p><h2>「瘋狂計程車：極速環遊」最終目的地「印度」地圖公開！</h2><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><p>計劃於2027年發售的「<strong>瘋狂計程車：極速環遊</strong>」是一款駕駛動作遊戲，玩家在城市中盡情馳騁，體驗動感十足的駕駛樂趣。<br/>故事模式等玩法中涵蓋的全部5座城市裡的最後一站「印度」已正式公佈！<br/>不妨透過<a href=\"https://youtu.be/06TXMGGCRNE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">全新預告片</a>，一睹 融合了歷史、自然與文化的獨特賽道 ，邂逅印度地圖中個性鮮明的乘客，並探索豐富多彩的各類活動。</p><h3>印度地圖的魅力！不僅有世界遺產「泰姬陵」，還有與知名品牌聯名的店鋪</h3><figure><img alt=\"泰姬陵\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3215969408f62d9551400ad2eda9eb58a5444db1b55126c3291338d4914606f1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe36bf9142da5cf6aa1e6f2e36b081730.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>泰姬陵</figcaption></figure><p></p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/crazytaxi-worldtour-India-map-announcement-02.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"街並み\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e9852a689c33a1c4a729df1cfa9529c7b3c625fbe58d38b4dc5f66df381200ef/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9e643cec25b4085060ef6c89cfcf2b41.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>街並み</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/crazytaxi-worldtour-India-map-announcement-03.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"街並み\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/17583bcce31f19cc77ca0bce821a36ee98b70778e277ddff10761eb6fa0ea4e6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2b70bbd715ba61cd5fe7aa222d359ab9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>街並み</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/crazytaxi-worldtour-India-map-announcement-04.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"街並み\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0772c6f2f5707d0d83ecbefd57d17e82bb00535f2b596701818e7712c800aee4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fadf8b562ee0fd8c780457fdac71f9550.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>街並み</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/crazytaxi-worldtour-India-map-announcement-05.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"街並み\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d55e5f200a071a51a73d5131d0f5969b470498d9008c353e0f4c730a227ff526/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc40681b4aa8009d46bfd13b44d2f9718.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>街並み</figcaption></a><p>在印度地圖上，不僅有 被列入世界遺產的「泰姬陵」 ，還有神秘的遺跡群、<strong>世界最古老級別的鐵路</strong>等，處處可見充滿歷史氣息的建築。<br/>可以穿梭於這座充滿印度獨有活力與刺激感的城市，領略壯麗的大自然，以及獨具魅力的<strong>露天市集</strong>等。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><figure><img alt=\"Bikanervala\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/118bc66c7a9303e0c56d313e0fd29f41a242f48fe81520e0c2cd66e84e796233/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F57721b52f86f6a812a1465555ee0ec7f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Bikanervala</figcaption></figure><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/crazytaxi-worldtour-India-map-announcement-07.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"The Souled Store\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4da60f758c0320c90e777114ebb248249f3fd5ba3bba24e4f5c1db015da08b34/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa47d43c4f713783e4944a586f3e1561b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>The Souled Store</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/crazytaxi-worldtour-India-map-announcement-08.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shalom\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d40bdfc5ab7b893a2cb79b194edd02174f07f2f21a7ae2906628e3ab90bd721b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F402b8f56a76d6df0a09c59e8cb464dc6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Shalom</figcaption></a><p>此外，也與 Bikanervala」、「The Souled Store」、「Shalom」 等印度當地的人氣品牌展開合作。<br/>這些合作門店將作為計程車的目的地登場。</p><h3>「瘋狂計程車：極速環遊」願望清單現已開放登記！</h3><p>在以世界各地城市為主題的地圖上，盡情體驗自由馳騁的駕駛樂趣「瘋狂計程車：極速環遊」<br/>本作現已在各平台的商店頁面開放願望清單登記！</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.xbox.com/ja-jp/games/store/Crazy-Taxi-World-Tour/9PCL8F2K2LT2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft Store</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://store.playstation.com/ja-jp/concept/10009925\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PlayStation Store</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2924540/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Steam</a></p></li></ul><p>Nintendo Switch 2 版的商店頁面計劃於日後公開</p><p>詳情請查看<a href=\"https://crazytaxi-asia.sega.com/worldtour/ja/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「瘋狂計程車：極速環遊」官網</a>，獲取最新資訊請關注官方X(<a href=\"https://twitter.com/crazytaxi_JP\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@crazytaxi_JP</a>)！</p><blockquote><p></p><p>『クレイジータクシー：ワールドツアー』<br/>全５MAP最後の地は…</p><p>／<br/>【インド】🇮🇳✨<br/>＼</p><p>歴史ある寺院や青空市場を駆け抜けよう！<br/>ボリウッド映画の撮影に遭遇することも！？🎬💨</p><p>人生を彩る刺激を見つけに、インドへ！🔥 <a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AC%E3%82%BF%E3%82%AF?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#クレタク</a><a href=\"https://t.co/ft2pKdTVS1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/ft2pKdTVS1</a></p><p>— クレイジータクシー：ワールドツアー【日本公式】 (@crazytaxi_JP) <a href=\"https://x.com/crazytaxi_JP/status/2122494936507420959?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">November 17, 2026</a></p></blockquote><table><tbody><tr><td><p>遊戲簡介</p></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><p>名稱</p></td><td><p>瘋狂計程車：極速環遊</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>對應機種</p></td><td><p>XBOX Series X|S、XBOX on PC、Steam、PlayStation 5、Nintendo Switch 2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>類別</p></td><td><p>駕駛動作</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>玩家人數</p></td><td><p>1人(線上多人遊玩時：最多6人)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>發售日期</p></td><td><p>預計2027年發售</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/finalfantasyxiv-evercoldcampaign-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「白銀的探求者冒險準備活動」開跑！「FF14」正式版60%OFF、最多30天免費登入</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/stranger-than-heaven-2nd-trailer-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「STRANGER THAN HEAVEN」第2支預告片公開！吳篇故事有髭男・藤原聰與日本社長・辻也出演</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/tokyoesportsfesta-2027-ambassador-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「東京電競嘉年華2027」官方大使連續兩年由 StanMi Japan 擔任！競賽項目新增「快打6」</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/moomin-mm/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「姆明：瘋狂夏日」發售！也正在舉辦9折上市特賣</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/metaphor-switch2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「暗喻幻想：ReFantazio」終於登上Nintendo Switch 2！以臺幣770或港幣187的新價格享受超名作奇幻RPG</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:59:06.986205+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1386,"images":9,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T03:05:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:52:42.421443+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T03:52:42.421443+00:00","content_hash":"8678ea43b277b683cef620411b58ddf1d4d14e85d4573183b002a717e815d918","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}